{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"「SmartPLAY」康體通疑資料外洩　初步約9萬人受影響\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SMART-PLAY-261127-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】康文署「SmartPLAY」康體通懷疑有資料外洩，初步約9萬人受影響。</p><p>私隱專員公署接獲事故通報指，初步顯示，可能有約9萬人受影響，包括姓名、性別、出生日期、地址、電郵地址和電話號碼。公署正調查事故，提醒相關機構盡快通知受影響人士。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.759772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:34:40.704910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:26.041203+00:00","content_hash":"2663ed39e5ac9239ce40f596220ed49b6b647942125418ee5f0aa09ca8b2beec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}